{"id":"b932045a4446f26a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-divisibility.md","title":"Divisibility Relation","display":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-divisibility","aliases":["58-df-divisibility","58-df-divides"],"display":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-divisibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-divisibility</span><span>58-df-divides</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divisibility — Divisibility Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Omega}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Omega}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Div}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Omega}_S(\\omega)\\land a\\in\\omega\\land b\\in\\omega\\land\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;(b=a\\cdot q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Div}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Omega}_S(\\omega)\\land a\\in\\omega\\land b\\in\\omega\\land\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;(b=a\\cdot q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\mid b\">\\(a \\mid b\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 整除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>（存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b = a \\times q\">\\(b = a \\times q\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>整除关系是原始递归的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(a, b)\">\\(\\gcd(a, b)\\)</span> 通过最大公因子递归计算</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>58-df-prime-number — 素数</li>\n<li>58-df-finite-sequence — 序列编码（素数用于编码）</li>\n<li>58-df-recursive — 递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Omega}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Omega}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divisibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Div}(a,b)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Omega}_S(\\omega)\\land a\\in\\omega\\land b\\in\\omega\\land\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;(b=a\\cdot q)","display":true},{"tex":"a \\mid b","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"b = a \\times q","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(a, b)","display":false}],"bytes":940,"backlinks":[{"id":"79b32ea25a3ad603","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}\\subseteq V^2$ (自然数整除谓词, see [[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]])"},{"id":"e214576ff8a9409d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Div}\\subseteq V^2$ (整除关系, see [[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]])"},{"id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the natural-number divisibility predicate (see [[58-df-divisibility]])"},{"id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (divisibility predicate, see [[58-df-divisibility]])"},{"id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (整除谓词，见 [[58-df-divisibility]])"},{"id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega$，且对 $a,b\\in\\omega$，$a\\mid b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(a,b)$；$\\operatorname{Div}$ 使用 [[58-df-divisibility.md]]。"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-447","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md|58-df-divisibility]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb"]}